[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 7321.83, "timestamp": "02:02:01", "text": "我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7326.629, "timestamp": "02:02:06", "text": "每次都展示我去过的所有附近地区，这样可以吗？   是的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7328.47, "timestamp": "02:02:08", "text": "，这里是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7332.47, "timestamp": "02:02:12", "text": "我的好地方之一。 我来到这里。 同一"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7336.55, "timestamp": "02:02:16", "text": "地区。 哦，等等。 你看不见。 嗯，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7338.39, "timestamp": "02:02:18", "text": "相机"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7340.47, "timestamp": "02:02:20", "text": "闪光灯。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7343.03, "timestamp": "02:02:23", "text": "和二号公园的情况一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7346.47, "timestamp": "02:02:26", "text": "上面长了个东西……嗯，是的。   是的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7355.99, "timestamp": "02:02:35", "text": "呃，还有秋千。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7359.589, "timestamp": "02:02:39", "text": "总有一天我会做到。 今天我做不到。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7361.669, "timestamp": "02:02:41", "text": "嗯。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7364.55, "timestamp": "02:02:44", "text": "而且下着雨，天气很湿。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7366.95, "timestamp": "02:02:46", "text": "地面湿了。"}]